WEBVTT

00:00:57.663 --> 00:01:00.987
that left some behind and many ignored.

00:01:01.011 --> 00:01:02.998
Where there was promise,

00:01:03.022 --> 00:01:04.910
there was a huge problem.

00:01:04.934 --> 00:01:08.370
You see, democracy,
as it was originally designed,

00:01:08.394 --> 00:01:09.720
had a fatal flaw.

00:01:10.188 --> 00:01:15.640
It only laid pipeline
for rich white men to progress.

00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:19.091
And now, if you're a smart rich white man,

00:01:19.115 --> 00:01:22.480
you understand why I say that's a problem.

00:01:22.504 --> 00:01:25.845
Massive talent has been left
off the field.

00:01:26.201 --> 00:01:29.788
Our moral imaginations have grown anemic.

00:01:29.812 --> 00:01:33.760
Our highest offices
are plagued by corruption.